# Performance

- **Lazy-load routes** with `React.lazy` + `Suspense` for any page > 30KB
- **Images**: use CDN transforms or `loading="lazy"` with explicit `width`/`height` to prevent CLS
- **Memoize heavy work** (`useMemo`, `React.memo`) only with a measured reason — no premature memoization
- **Bundle budget**: main chunk < 300KB gzipped — fail PR if exceeded
- **No barrel `index.ts` re-exports** of large modules — they break tree-shaking
